Package: eduka-konekta
Version: 0.0.6
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-cryptography, ffmpeg, iproute2, v4l-utils, pulseaudio-utils
Recommends: adwaita-icon-theme, fonts-noto-core
Maintainer: Hugo Moniz do Rego <grupoideatl@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://edukasaunos.tl
Description: lightweight peer-to-peer group chat for schools
 Eduka-Konekta connects teachers and students directly over IP without a
 central chat server. It provides signed persistent device identities, LAN
 discovery across Ethernet and Wi-Fi interfaces, refresh and bounded subnet
 probing, direct and teacher-managed group chat, 30-minute message controls,
 document transfer, status feed, desktop notifications, profile photos,
 webcam video and microphone voice recording. Chat data is erased on close;
 the active profile remains signed in until the user logs out.
